    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the executive law, in relation to expanding the duties of the\noffice of children and family services concerning lesbian, gay, bisexual, and\ntransgender runaway and homeless youth",
    "basePrintNo": "S1481",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S1481-2019",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
